  "description": "<p>Introducing Heads Up! Our headboard pillow is sure to bring comfort to your bedroom with its plush design and ergonomic shape. Say goodbye to uncomfortable headboards and hello to a cozy night's sleep. If you want your whole headboard to feel like a cushy pillow, Sleepyhead Heads Up pillow is the perfect solution. It provides the perfect angle for propping yourself up in bed while reading, binge-watching your favourite show or living the WFH life. It is designed to give you ergonomic support &amp; comfort. Made from hollow fibre fill and wrapped in a premium brushed fabric it bounces back into shape even after long hours of use. Simply rest against your headboard or wall and relax. You’ve never experienced comfort like it before. What sets Heads Up apart from other headboard pillows is that it’s multi-functional and its quirky name - you can use it to prop yourself up, to sleep on, in your bedroom, living room or outdoors. And it's impossible not to smile when you say the name! Whether you want to add fun to your bedroom or just want to lounge comfortably, Heads Up is the perfect pillow.The soft and breathable hollow fibre filling with just the right firmness provides excellent support. It’s made from premium micro-finish peach fabric that is pill-resistant, soft to the touch and is easy to maintain. The wedge shape provides support to cradle the back and shoulders.</p>",
